bside-trace 1
# Volume steps with every voice silent (envelopes at 0): the output steps by the voices
# DC level times the volume change; the board high-pass turns each step into a decaying
# pulse. Read the frame levels after each write (frame 0 holds the power-on transient;
# the first step comes after 1 s). Steps are 1 s apart (40 frames). Then the same with
# oscillator 1 routed to the filter (low-pass).
clock 985248
model B
8 18 00
# volume 15
985258 18 0f
# volume 0
1970506 18 00
# volume 8
2955754 18 08
# volume 15
3941002 18 0f
# volume 4
4926250 18 04
# volume 0
5911498 18 00
# oscillator 1 routed to the filter, low-pass
6896746 17 01
6896746 18 10
# volume 15 (low-pass)
7881994 18 1f
# volume 0 (low-pass)
8867242 18 10
# volume 8 (low-pass)
9852490 18 18
end 10837728
